		{
			description: [
				"Deep in the deepslate, inside a ball of amethyst, the bedrock is cracked."
				"It glows faintly. Break it and a ladder leads down, into the Dark Zone."
				""
				"A survey crew went down there when the cracks first opened. None of them came back."
				"Their caches are still down there, and so are their &eNight Vision Goggles&r:"
				"the only night vision gear left in this world."
				""
				"&7How to find it: dig toward the deepest caves (below Y -24) and look for amethyst."
			]
