			dependencies: ["7D7C710000000001"]
			description: [
				"Down here it is always dark, and the &cHollow Zombies&r are blind. They hunt by sound."
				""
				"- Crouch to walk silently. Running is heard from far away."
				"- Loose scree and old bones crunch even when crouching: go around them."
				"- Sculk sensors and shriekers call them from across the tunnels."
				"- Gunshots carry the farthest. Blades are quieter."
				"- Light keeps new ones from appearing, but does not scare off those already near."
				"- A thrown &ePhosphor Flare&r cracks loudly where it lands: they go there instead of you."
				"- Close up, they still see what is right in front of them."
			]
			icon: "seven_days_darkzone:hollow_zombie_spawn_egg"
